        <ns0:content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <ns0:p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.8" marginRight="0" defaultTabSize="72"><ns0:em><ns0:span color="rgba(0, 112, 192, 1)" fontSize="18" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">面向麻醉科医生与围术期团队：术前评估输入患者病历与监护波形，输出风险分级与麻醉关注点报告；</ns0:span></ns0:em></ns0:p>
          <ns0:p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.8" marginRight="0" defaultTabSize="72"><ns0:em><ns0:span color="rgba(0, 112, 192, 1)" fontSize="18" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">基层医院可借此补齐评估规范性，缓解麻醉医生短缺下的评估质量压力。</ns0:span></ns0:em></ns0:p>
        </ns0:content>
